WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.985
Minwoo: It's hot!

2
00:00:03.986 --> 00:00:06.104
Open the window. Peter:

3
00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:17.270
Okay. Minwoo:

4
00:00:17.271 --> 00:00:20.869
Sally, please turn off the light.

5
00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:26.014
Sally: I’m sorry, Minwoo.

6
00:00:26.015 --> 00:00:31.174
Minwoo: Turn on the TV, Peter.

7
00:00:31.175 --> 00:00:39.304
Turn off the computer, Sally.

8
00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:46.379
Minwoo’s Mom: Minwoo! Get off the table!

